      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are square matrices?\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$H =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $A$ is not a square matrix.\n\n- $H$ is not a square matrix.\n\n- $N$ is not a square matrix.\n\nTherefore, none of these matrices are square matrices.",
